# Akan Name Generator

##  Author

Tania Okoth

---

##  Description

This is a simple web application that calculates the day of the week a user was born and assigns them an Akan name based on their gender.

The application takes the user’s birthdate (day, month, and year), determines the exact day of the week, and then matches it with the corresponding Akan name from Ghanaian culture.

---

##  Features

* User inputs their birthdate
* User selects their gender
* Application validates user input
* Calculates the correct day of the week
* Displays the correct Akan name
* Shows alert messages for invalid inputs

---

##  Technologies Used

* HTML
* CSS
* JavaScript

---

##  Setup Instructions

1. Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/taniauniaokoth/Akan-Name-Generator
```

2. Navigate into the project folder:

```bash
cd akan-name-generator
```

3. Open `index.html` in your browser

