---

##  BDD (Behavior Driven Development)

| Behavior                          | Input                    | Output                     |
| --------------------------------- | ------------------------ | -------------------------- |
| User enters valid date and gender | Day, Month, Year, Gender | Displays correct Akan name |
| User leaves fields empty          | No input                 | Alert message shown        |
| User enters invalid date          | e.g Month > 12           | Alert message shown        |

---

##  How It Works

The application uses JavaScript to:

* Collect user input from the form
* Validate the data
* Use the built-in Date object to determine the day of the week
* Match the result with predefined Akan name arrays
* Display the result on the webpage

